  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38755822813b6e6e5dbe3/step-efdcdd00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Finely chop garlic. Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook zucchini and broccoli, until tender, 6-7 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl, season and set aside.\n• TIP: Add a dash of water to the pan to help speed up the cooking process.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38755822813b6e6e5dbe3/step-4a1e7c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium and add cooked egg noodles, veggies, Asian stir-fry sauce, the soy sauce, brown sugar and water, stirring to combine, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38755822813b6e6e5dbe3/step-60f3bf20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide quick sweet soy tofu and veggie noodles between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots. Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e38755822813b6e6e5dbe3/step-32d6d530.jpg"
    }
  ]
